  "experiment": "Start from the archived forward-only candidate in forward-readout-trials-20261123.json. Collect 72 ordinary sampled matches with self-play-rollout.ts --episodes 72 --seconds 36 --seed 16309215 --focus wall --focus waiting, frozen bundled opponent. Use the parent's normal right-aligned encoder with per-life reset. For a positive example require ten same-life observations (4 previous, current, 5 future), all unseen with expired sighting memory and nonnegative camera depths. Each of the last four poses must be within 0.6 m of current pose. First subsequent movement exceeds 0.12 m and position after five steps is over 1.4 m away. Fit the sampled strafe and forward logits minus the parent logits on positive examples; anchor residual to zero elsewhere. Add an intercept and solve weighted ridge regression with L2 0.08, then apply half the fitted residual. Group masses in counts order are 0.5 (other), 2 (visible or recent), 1 (escape). The strafe-only ablation restores the parent forward row. This fit uses simulator outcomes and an existing trained actor; the cloud continues using its approved human captures.",
